DTSTART:20260114T070000Z
DTEND:20260115T070000Z
SUMMARY:Feast of the Ass
DESCRIPTION:History: Medieval French parishes staged the Feast of the Ass t
 o honour the donkey that carried the Holy Family during the Flight into Eg
 ypt and other biblical journeys.\nTraditions: A bedecked donkey processed 
 to church while congregations answered prayers with playful brays\, blendi
 ng devotion with carnival humour.\nFeasting: Le repas rustique propose pai
 n de campagne\, soupe aux pois secs\, galette au miel\, tarte aux noix\, f
 romage de chevre\, and cruches de vin epice hypocras shared in honour of t
 he humble ane.\nDay: Wednesday\n\nIcon: 🐴\nCategory: cultural
CATEGORIES:cultural
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-IMAGE:/images/feast-of-the-ass-medieval-festival-celebrating-the-flight-into-egypt.png
END:VEVENT
