SUMMARY:Saint Patrick's Day
DESCRIPTION:History: Patrick's fifth-century mission in Ireland inspired me
 dieval hagiographies\, and Irish diaspora communities transformed his feas
 t into global parades of pride.\nTraditions: Bagpipers march past green la
 ndmarks\, shamrock pins bedeck lapels\, and Gaelic blessings are shared be
 tween friends and strangers alike.\nFeasting: Menus highlight corned beef 
 and cabbage\, soda bread\, colcannon\, smoked salmon\, and stout or whiske
 y raised in hearty toast.\nDay: Tuesday\n\nIcon: ☘️\nCategory: cultura
 l
CATEGORIES:cultural
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
