SUMMARY:Spring Equinox (Ostara)
DESCRIPTION:History: The equinox marks a moment of near-equal day and night as spring gathers strength.\nTraditions: People welcome returning light with early garden work, fresh greens, and mindful balance rituals.\nFeasting: Seasonal plates highlight herbs, eggs, citrus, and first tender vegetables.\nDay: Friday\n\nIcon: 🌸\nCategory: seasonal
