SUMMARY:Nowruz
DESCRIPTION:History: Nowruz is the Persian New Year rooted in ancient springtime renewal traditions.\nTraditions: Families set the Haft-Seen table, clean the home, visit loved ones, and celebrate the first day of spring.\nFeasting: Shared foods include herb-forward dishes, sweets, tea, and celebratory rice.\nDay: Friday\n\nIcon: 🌿\nCategory: cultural
