DESCRIPTION:History: Palm Sunday begins Holy Week, recalling the entry into Jerusalem.\nTraditions: Communities carry palms, sing, and prepare for the week of remembrance.\nFeasting: Simple seasonal meals and shared bread often follow worship.\nDay: Sunday\n\nIcon: 🌿\nCategory: cultural
