SUMMARY:Earth Day
DESCRIPTION:History: US senator Gaylord Nelson and organiser Denis Hayes la
 unched Earth Day in 1970\, igniting the modern environmental movement with
  teach-ins across the country.\nTraditions: Volunteers plant trees\, clean
  waterways\, host sustainability workshops\, and advocate for climate just
 ice at community fairs.\nFeasting: Earth-friendly gatherings feature seaso
 nal salads\, plant-based potlucks\, fair-trade coffee\, and desserts sweet
 ened with local honey.\nDay: Wednesday\n\nIcon: 🌍\nCategory: environmen
 tal
CATEGORIES:environmental
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-IMAGE:/images/celebrate-our-planet-and-environmental-awareness.png
