SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox (Mabon)
DESCRIPTION:History: The equinox equalises day and night worldwide\, inspir
 ing harvest observances from Ancient Greece's Thesmophoria to modern pagan
  Mabon rites.\nTraditions: People decorate altars with gourds and leaves\,
  practice gratitude journaling\, and take twilight walks to feel the seaso
 nal balance.\nFeasting: Harvest tables brim with roasted squash\, apple ta
 rts\, caramelised root vegetables\, mulled cider\, and hearty grain salads
 .\nDay: Tuesday\n\nIcon: 🍂\nCategory: seasonal
CATEGORIES:seasonal
STATUS:CONFIRMED
