SUMMARY:Winter Solstice (Yule)
DESCRIPTION:History: The solstice marks the sun's rebirth in cultures from 
 Norse Yule to East Asian Dongzhi\, blending astronomy with spiritual renew
 al.\nTraditions: People burn yule logs\, exchange handmade gifts\, meditat
 e at sunrise\, and decorate with evergreen boughs and lights symbolising r
 eturning warmth.\nFeasting: Roasted meats\, spiced mead\, citrus preserves
 \, and solstice cakes shaped like the sun celebrate the lengthening days a
 head.\nDay: Sunday\n\nIcon: ❄️\nCategory: seasonal
CATEGORIES:seasonal
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-IMAGE:/images/polar-bear-solstice.svg
END:VEVENT
